OL,3,GNEWSATheatre's concern as football
OL,4,Apitch set to be approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe manager of an open air theatre says
OL,7,Fhe is disappointed that plans for
OL,8,Fartificial football pitches nearby have
OL,9,Fbeen recommended for approval, but
OL,10,Fwants to work to ensure the two sites
OL,11,Fcan co-exist.
OL,13,FBrighton Open Air Theatre (Boat) says
OL,14,Fperformances would be "essentially
OL,15,Funviable" due to noise issues arising
OL,16,Ffrom proposed plans for pitches put
OL,17,Fforward by Brighton, Hove & Sussex
OL,18,FSixth Form College (Bhasvic).
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
