OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATheatre's concern as football
OL,4,Apitch set to be approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FWill Mytum, Boat's general manager,
OL,7,Fsaid that the plans would still affect
OL,8,Funamplified performances despite
OL,9,Fmitigations put in place.
OL,11,FPlans for the pitches and multi-use
OL,12,Fgame area go before Brighton & Hove
OL,13,FCity Council's planning committee on
OL,14,FWednesday.
